+## Good Bear isolated Russian PKI navigation consent
+
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-title = Good Bear — Russian PKI
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-address = Moving to the isolated container does not transfer request data. Open only the address?
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-body = Requests with data are never replayed automatically. Open only the address in the isolated container without the request data?
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-open-address = Open the address in the Russian PKI container
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-go-back = Go back
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-trust-changed-title = Good Bear — trust source changed
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-trust-changed-address = This site previously used the standard trust infrastructure. Its certificate is now validated through Russian PKI. Good Bear will not send ordinary-container data to this connection.
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-trust-changed-body = This site previously used the standard trust infrastructure. Its certificate is now validated through Russian PKI. Good Bear will not send ordinary-container data or replay the request with data.
+goodbear-russian-pki-prompt-open-isolated = Open in isolation
